 "text": "Hi, how have you been? You can still order them if the shop is open. Which it likely is, given it's restaurant night. Then ask the shop to hold them, and pick them up on way back. Or leave them in the shop over night, and fetch them in the morning. Sticks are pretty light, so bit of wind is no problem. Much bigger risk is if it rains heavily before you get back, and the shop room fills up. Then all those sticks are at risk. Sticks need a bit of an adventure. You could always carry them, and show off your strength. Then at least put them in the car and surprise her with them when you get home.",
